---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Crear cuenta" auth>
  <div class="auth-shell">
    <section class="auth-form"><a class="auth-mark" href="/login"><span>NW</span> NorthWind</a><div class="eyebrow">REGISTRO SEGURO</div><h1>Crea tu cuenta</h1><p>Completa tus datos para acceder a la plataforma comercial.</p>
      <form id="register-form"><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="first">Nombres <span>*</span></label><input id="first" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="Carlos" /></div><div class="field"><label for="last">Apellidos <span>*</span></label><input id="last" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="family-name" placeholder="Bejarano" /></div></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Correo electrónico <span>*</span></label><input id="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="nombre@ejemplo.com" /></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="password">Contraseña <span>*</span></label><div class="password-control"><input id="password" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" /><button type="button" class="password-toggle" data-toggle-password="password" aria-controls="password" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg><span>Ver</span></button></div></div><div class="field"><label for="confirm">Confirmar contraseña <span>*</span></label><div class="password-control"><input id="confirm" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password" minlength="6" /><button type="button" class="password-toggle" data-toggle-password="confirm" aria-controls="confirm" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Mostrar confirmación de contraseña"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg><span>Ver</span></button></div></div></div><div class="password-rules" id="password-rules"><span data-rule="len">○ Mínimo 6 caracteres</span><span data-rule="upper">○ Una mayúscula</span><span data-rule="lower">○ Una minúscula</span><span data-rule="digit">○ Un número</span><span data-rule="special">○ Un carácter especial</span><span data-rule="match">○ Contraseñas iguales</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="register-submit">Crear cuenta <span>→</span></button></form>
      <div class="auth-bottom">¿Ya tienes una cuenta? <a href="/login">Inicia sesión</a></div>
    </section><aside class="auth-aside"><div class="auth-ornament">✧</div><div><h2>Un sistema.<br/>Más posibilidades.</h2><p>Controla tus ventas con mayor claridad desde una interfaz rápida, moderna y adaptable.</p><div class="auth-points"><div><b>✓</b> Registro validado por la API</div><div><b>✓</b> Catálogos y órdenes centralizadas</div><div><b>✓</b> Acceso a comprobantes PDF</div></div></div><footer>NORTHWIND COMMERCE · ASTRO EDITION</footer></aside>
  </div>
  <script src="../scripts/register.ts"></script>
</AppLayout>
